# One def, tile, whose kind parameter is one_of(disc square ring). Three cells of 64x64 on a 192x64 artboard, each tile centered in its cell.
# Left to right: tile with no kind (the first word, disc: a solid blue disc of radius 20);
# tile kind:square (a solid red square 40 wide, which shows a named word from the list is accepted);
# tile ring (an ink ring of radius 20 with no fill, which shows a positional word is checked against the same list).
@artboard 192x64
@target components/one_of.png

def tile kind:one_of(disc square ring)
  if kind == disc
    circle 20 fill:p.blue name:disc
  if kind == square
    rect 40 fill:p.red name:square
  if kind == ring
    circle 20 fill:none stroke:p.ink,3 name:ring

tile at:32,32 name:first
tile kind:square at:96,32 name:second
tile ring at:160,32 name:third
